<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Excite raised to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Excite raised to strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc said it raised its rating of Excite Inc to a strong buy from a buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 10 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- The company went public in April at $17 a share.</p>
</text>
